<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (1. Single Inheritance: In this Inheritance we have only one child class and one parent class. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
